WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.005
Dad was spending more time in the attic.

2
00:00:04.006 --> 00:00:08.065
Vinnie and Mandy were getting anxious.

3
00:00:08.066 --> 00:00:12.307
The attic was looking more like a tidy office.

4
00:00:12.308 --> 00:00:16.952
The children were running out of places to hide the album.

5
00:00:16.953 --> 00:00:19.989
"We have to do something,"

6
00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:23.855
Mandy said as she sat in the kitchen.

7
00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:27.990
Dad was in the attic, setting up his computer.

8
00:00:27.991 --> 00:00:31.982
Suddenly they heard a familiar bark.

9
00:00:31.983 --> 00:00:35.153
"Corky!" yelled Vinnie.

10
00:00:35.154 --> 00:00:38.497
He ran to the front door and opened it.

11
00:00:38.498 --> 00:00:42.330
The next door neighbor stood there with his dog.

12
00:00:42.331 --> 00:00:45.993
"Hey, Vinnie," said the neighbor, smiling.

13
00:00:45.994 --> 00:00:48.069
"Is your dad home?

14
00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:53.122
He promised to drive me to the auto repair shop to pick up my car."

15
00:00:53.123 --> 00:00:58.410
"Dad! Corky’s here!" yelled Mandy excitedly.

16
00:00:58.411 --> 00:01:02.494
The children knew how much Dad loved dogs.

17
00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:07.675
"Hey, Corky!" Dad said, coming down the stairs.

18
00:01:07.676 --> 00:01:13.381
He petted Corky, and the dog wagged its tail happily.

19
00:01:13.382 --> 00:01:16.303
"Tell your mom I’ll be right back,"

20
00:01:16.304 --> 00:01:20.339
he said to the children, grabbing his car keys.

21
00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:25.148
"Take your time!" Vinnie and Mandy exclaimed.

22
00:01:25.149 --> 00:01:30.679
As soon as Dad was gone, they ran up to the attic.

23
00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:36.519
Last time, the children had hid the album behind a large plant.

24
00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:42.002
"Whew! It’s still here," Vinnie said with relief.

25
00:01:42.003 --> 00:01:46.164
He opened the album. "Mandy, look!"

26
00:01:46.165 --> 00:01:49.822
They were almost at the end of the album.

27
00:01:49.823 --> 00:01:56.831
"What happens when we get to the last page?" Mandy asked sadly.

28
00:01:56.832 --> 00:02:01.200
"Let’s think about that later," Vinnie said quickly.

29
00:02:01.201 --> 00:02:03.645
He turned the page.

30
00:02:03.646 --> 00:02:09.157
"Wow! What is that?" Mandy cried.

31
00:02:09.158 --> 00:02:12.396
The photo showed a large temple.

32
00:02:12.397 --> 00:02:15.976
People were walking up its steep steps.

33
00:02:15.977 --> 00:02:18.925
They held glowing objects.

34
00:02:18.926 --> 00:02:22.606
The old man stood watching them nearby.

35
00:02:22.607 --> 00:02:27.805
"It looks like some kind of a parade," Vinnie said.

36
00:02:27.806 --> 00:02:30.745
"I wonder where this is."

37
00:02:30.746 --> 00:02:38.988
Before the children could say another word, they fell down the dark tunnel.

38
00:02:38.989 --> 00:02:42.924
Mandy landed first in some soft dirt.

39
00:02:42.925 --> 00:02:45.095
She took a deep breath.

40
00:02:45.096 --> 00:02:50.611
"Stinky!" she cried, holding her nose.

41
00:02:50.612 --> 00:02:54.358
"Hey! Ow!" Vinnie cried.

42
00:02:54.359 --> 00:02:59.891
He had hit something hard after his fall down the tunnel.

43
00:02:59.892 --> 00:03:02.904
The children opened their eyes.

44
00:03:02.905 --> 00:03:08.126
Two pairs of big brown eyes looked down at them.

45
00:03:08.127 --> 00:03:15.113
"Uh, hello?" Mandy said softly to two large oxen.

46
00:03:15.114 --> 00:03:18.337
Vinnie had bounced off an ox!

47
00:03:18.338 --> 00:03:22.696
"This must be some kind of farm,"

48
00:03:22.697 --> 00:03:26.292
said Vinnie, still rubbing his back.

49
00:03:26.293 --> 00:03:28.869
The children stood up.

50
00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:32.411
They were next to a barn with no walls.

51
00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:36.549
Its straw roof was held up by wooden poles.

52
00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:42.135
Suddenly the ox Vinnie had hit let out an angry snort.

53
00:03:42.136 --> 00:03:48.999
The animal shook its head and began to dig at the ground with one hoof.

54
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.745
The children froze.

55
00:03:51.746 --> 00:04:01.646
Vinnie gulped. "I think he’s getting ready to attack."

